Run TensileCreateLibrary once per GPU architecture.

One process holding every gfx* solution set is killed on ABF,
and TensileLogic --check-all OOMs joblib workers. Skip validation
and build each architecture separately. Keep the logic/codegen
manifest so an edited generator still dirties the stamps.

--- a/cmake/hipblaslt_codegen.cmake
+++ b/cmake/hipblaslt_codegen.cmake
